msgstr ""

#: ../mnt/documentation/content/applications/productivity/ai/access_policy.rst:246
msgid "``perm_read`` = Deny at model level for the bot group, **or**"
msgstr ""

#: ../mnt/documentation/content/applications/productivity/ai/access_policy.rst:247
msgid "``perm_read`` = Allow with field-level **Deny** on ``name``, ``description``, ``partner_ids``, ``videocall_location``, and similar."
