msgstr ""

#: ../mnt/documentation/content/applications/productivity/ai/agent_recipes.rst:29
msgid "Leave Write/Delete/Web off unless the recipe needs them. Agent writes default to **supervisor confirmation** via the task's :guilabel:`Write mode`; only set *hybrid* / *auto* when the mission is deliberately draft-safe (see :ref:`ai/agents/task-write-mode`)."
msgstr ""

