#: ../mnt/documentation/content/applications/productivity/ai/app_integrations.rst:115
msgid "The button :guilabel:`Subject lines with AI` next to the subject reads the mailing and proposes three subject lines in a dialog. Click :guilabel:`Use` next to the one you like to set it as the subject. The button disappears once the mailing has been sent."
