msgstr ""

#: ../mnt/documentation/content/applications/productivity/ai/app_integrations.rst:123
msgid "On the timesheet list, :guilabel:`Draft with AI` opens a dialog where you pick a day (today by default) and click :guilabel:`Propose`. For that day the AI looks at your calendar meetings, the tasks assigned to you that changed, the messages you wrote on tasks and the timesheets you already logged. It proposes lines with a task, a description and the hours. Each line has a checkbox and can be edited, and every line must name a task from the offered list. The hours are kept within sensible bounds and the day's total never goes above 24 hours. Click :guilabel:`Create timesheets` to create the lines you ticked. Nothing is logged without that click."
msgstr ""

#: ../mnt/documentation/content/applications/productivity/ai/app_integrations.rst:134
msgid "The timesheet assistant has no grid view because the grid view does not exist in the Community edition. Only your own messages on tasks are read, in your own environment."
