#: ../mnt/documentation/content/applications/productivity/dashboards.rst:114
msgid "**Change the order of dashboard sections** by using the :icon:`oi-draggable` :guilabel:`(drag handle)` icon to move a section to a new position."
msgstr ""

#: ../mnt/documentation/content/applications/productivity/dashboards.rst:117
msgid "**Duplicate a dashboard section** by selecting the relevant section name, clicking the :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`Actions` button, and then :icon:`fa-clone` :guilabel:`Duplicate`. The dashboards within the section are not duplicated."
msgstr ""

#: ../mnt/documentation/content/applications/productivity/dashboards.rst:121
msgid "**Delete a dashboard section** by selecting the relevant section name, clicking the :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`Actions` button, then :icon:`fa-trash-o` :guilabel:`Delete`."
msgstr ""

#: ../mnt/documentation/content/applications/productivity/dashboards.rst:125
msgid "Standard, pre-installed dashboard sections cannot be deleted; custom dashboard sections, on the other hand, can be deleted."
msgstr ""

#: ../mnt/documentation/content/applications/productivity/dashboards.rst:128
msgid "**Create a new dashboard section** by clicking :guilabel:`New`, then entering the section name."
msgstr ""

#: ../mnt/documentation/content/applications/productivity/dashboards.rst:130
msgid "Clicking on an individual dashboard section lists all dashboards within that section. The following actions are possible:"
msgstr ""

#: ../mnt/documentation/content/applications/productivity/dashboards.rst:133
msgid "**Change the order of a dashboard within its section** by using the :icon:`oi-draggable` :guilabel:`(drag handle)` icon to move the dashboard to a new position."
msgstr ""

#: ../mnt/documentation/content/applications/productivity/dashboards.rst:136
msgid "**Edit the name of a dashboard section or dashboard** by clicking the name and modifying it."
msgstr ""

#: ../mnt/documentation/content/applications/productivity/dashboards.rst:138
msgid "**Add or remove user groups** to :ref:`control access to the dashboard <dashboards/access-and-sharing>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../mnt/documentation/content/applications/productivity/dashboards.rst:141
msgid "**Select a company** if, in a :doc:`multi-company <../general/companies/multi_company>` database, the dashboard should only be visible to users of one company. If this field is left blank, the dashboard is visible to all users with the appropriate access rights, regardless of which company is currently selected in the database."
msgstr ""

#: ../mnt/documentation/content/applications/productivity/dashboards.rst:146
msgid "**Unpublish a dashboard** by disabling the :guilabel:`Is Published` toggle. Unpublished dashboards are no longer listed in the left panel of the Dashboards app."
msgstr ""

#: ../mnt/documentation/content/applications/productivity/dashboards.rst:149
msgid "**Delete a dashboard** by clicking the :icon:`fa-trash` :guilabel:`(trash)` icon."
msgstr ""

#: ../mnt/documentation/content/applications/productivity/dashboards.rst:152
msgid "A standard dashboard that is deleted is reinstalled when the corresponding app is updated."
