#: ../mnt/documentation/content/applications/productivity/documents.rst:47
msgid "Download several documents"
msgstr ""

#: ../mnt/documentation/content/applications/productivity/documents.rst:49
msgid "To download several documents at once, select them in the list view, click the :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`Actions` button, and select :guilabel:`Download Files`. Odoo proposes a file name for the archive (`files_<date>.zip`); confirm with :guilabel:`Download Files` to get all selected documents in a single ZIP file."
