#: ../mnt/documentation/content/applications/productivity/documents.rst:65
msgid ":guilabel:`Company`: leave empty to make the folder available to all companies."
msgstr ""

#: ../mnt/documentation/content/applications/productivity/documents.rst:66
msgid ":guilabel:`Sequence`: the order of the folders."
msgstr ""

#: ../mnt/documentation/content/applications/productivity/documents.rst:68
msgid "The :guilabel:`Documents` smart button opens the documents filed in the folder, and the :guilabel:`Child Folders` tab lists its subfolders."
msgstr ""

#: ../mnt/documentation/content/applications/productivity/documents.rst:72
msgid "Automatic folders"
msgstr ""

#: ../mnt/documentation/content/applications/productivity/documents.rst:74
msgid "In the :guilabel:`Automatic Folder` section, an :guilabel:`Auto Model` can be selected. Documents attached to a record of that model are then filed automatically in the folder, without the user having to select it. Subfolders of an automatic folder inherit this behavior."
msgstr ""

#: ../mnt/documentation/content/applications/productivity/documents.rst:89
msgid "Tags describe the content of a document. They are grouped into **tag categories**, and both the categories and the tags can be attached to a folder, so that only the relevant tags are proposed on a document of that folder."
