#: ../mnt/documentation/content/applications/productivity/documents.rst:130
msgid ":guilabel:`Model for the Operation`: the model of the record to create or to link to, and, optionally, a :guilabel:`Filter for the Operation Model` restricting the records proposed."
msgstr ""

#: ../mnt/documentation/content/applications/productivity/documents.rst:133
msgid "To run an operation, open a document and click :guilabel:`Operations` in the :guilabel:`Organize` section. Select the :guilabel:`Operation` and the target :guilabel:`Record`, then save: the document is attached to that record."
